// Catalog extension (#174): standard gym exercises and variations the catalog was missing. Library-only:
// never picked by the plan generator or "Generate from muscles" (keeps generated plans and the weekly
// structure as they are); members reach them from Explore, the workout builder and the swap sheet, where
// variations are grouped under their base exercise (`Exercise.variationOf`). Keep ids stable — they are persisted.

